{"sections":[{"slug":"同伦群","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"同伦群"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">同伦群</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"同伦群"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">本页面介绍</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的同伦群</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">又称非稳定同伦群</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">另见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/同伦群(稳定同伦论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">同伦群</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">稳定同伦论</span>)"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">同伦群是用</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/球面","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">球面</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">到一个空间</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":") $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的映射提取出的</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的同伦信息</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">注</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">虽然叫做同伦</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">群</span>”, <span lang=\"zh\">但</span> $-2,-1,0$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶同伦信息不构成群</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">或更一般的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/∞-意象","text":"$\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal{C}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对象</span>, $x\\colon *\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的点</span>, $n\\geq 0$ <span lang=\"zh\">为整数</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $x$ <span lang=\"zh\">处的</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶同伦群为</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $0$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span>"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\n\\pi_n(X,x) := \\tau_{\\leq 0} \\Omega^n(X,x).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\Omega^n(X,x)$ <span lang=\"zh\">也是</span> $(S^n,*)$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $(X,x)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的保基点映射空间</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">从而是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/En-代数","text":"$\\mathbb{E}_n$"}},{"Plain":"-<span lang=\"zh\">群</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">那么其截断</span> $\\pi_n(X,x)$ <span lang=\"zh\">也是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/En-代数","text":"$\\mathbb{E}_n$"}},{"Plain":"-<span lang=\"zh\">群</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">但由于其截断生活在一个</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">意象中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">故当</span> $n\\geq 2$ <span lang=\"zh\">时它已经是</span> $\\mathbb{E}_{\\infty}$-<span lang=\"zh\">群</span> (Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>). <span lang=\"zh\">当</span> $n=0$ <span lang=\"zh\">时它不是群</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">只是带基点对象</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">还有一种</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">整体</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的同伦群</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">可理解为同时记录了</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">在每一点处的同伦群</span>:\n<span lang=\"zh\">对</span> $n\\geq 0$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶同伦对象</span> $\\pi_n(X)\\in \\mathcal{C}_{/X}$ <span lang=\"zh\">如下</span>:\n$$\r\n\\pi_n(X) := \\tau_{\\leq 0} (X^{S^n}\\to X)\\in\\mathcal{C}_{/X}.\r\n$$\n$\\pi_n(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\mathcal{C}_{/X}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span> $0$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbb{E}_n$-<span lang=\"zh\">群</span>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">当然</span>, $\\pi_n(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">在点</span> $x\\colon *\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">处的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/基变换","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">基变换</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">即是</span> $\\pi_n(X,x)$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>$(-2)$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶同伦信息是平凡的</span>.</li>\n<li>$(-1)$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶同伦信息是</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">空</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">或</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">非空</span></strong>.</li>\n<li>$0$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶同伦信息是</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">连通分支的集合</span></strong>.</li>\n<li>$1$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶同伦信息是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/基本群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">基本群</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">拉回稳定性</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">保持余极限和有限极限的函子保持同伦群</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">长正合列</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">对</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/∞-意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的任意映射</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$, <span lang=\"zh\">有</span> $(\\mathcal C_{/X})_{\\leq 0}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的长正合列</span>\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n\\cdots&amp;\\to \\pi_n(f) \\to \\pi_n(X) \\to f^*\\pi_n(Y) \\\\\r\n&amp;\\to\\pi_{n-1}(f) \\to \\cdots.\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\pi_n(f)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $f\\in \\mathcal C_{/Y}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的同伦群</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $(\\mathcal C_{/Y})_{/f} = \\mathcal C_{/X}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对象</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/相对同伦群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">相对同伦群</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}